  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21463264",
      "title": "Rendering Content Conditionally",
      "lectureOrder": 43,
      "videoOrder": 38,
      "sourceHash": "bc259b7645e3e48f158d3e8b8d2a221c38b29150f1fe5d103797f5e9dd0b6bd3",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 5.35,
          "en": "So as outlined, I wanna show this paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.35,
          "end": 7.27,
          "en": "if we have no goals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.27,
          "end": 10.763,
          "en": "so if this goals array here is empty.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.72,
          "end": 15.58,
          "en": "And I wanna show this unordered list if we do have goals.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.58,
          "end": 19.53,
          "en": "So if we have at least one item in this goals array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.53,
          "end": 21.86,
          "en": "That's my idea here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.86,
          "end": 24.27,
          "en": "Now how can we implement this?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.27,
          "end": 26.46,
          "en": "First of all, you already noticed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.46,
          "end": 29.17,
          "en": "I'm no longer using this split screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.17,
          "end": 33.34,
          "en": "I no longer have JavaScript and HTML on top of each other,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.34,
          "end": 38.14,
          "en": "because I think we got used to how Vue worked with HTML,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.14,
          "end": 41,
          "en": "and I now wanna have more space available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41,
          "end": 43.52,
          "en": "for HTML and JavaScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.52,
          "end": 46.06,
          "en": "Hence, I'll just switch between those files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.06,
          "end": 47.84,
          "en": "But that's just a side note.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.84,
          "end": 50.45,
          "en": "How can we now make sure that this paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.45,
          "end": 53.2,
          "en": "only shows up if we do have no goals?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.2,
          "end": 55.55,
          "en": "So if goals is an empty array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.55,
          "end": 59.08,
          "en": "Well, Vue has a directive for us,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.08,
          "end": 62.08,
          "en": "a directive we can add on the element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.08,
          "end": 64.25,
          "en": "that should be rendered conditionally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.25,
          "end": 67.25,
          "en": "And that's the v-if directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.25,
          "end": 72.25,
          "en": "So it's basically like a if statement in JavaScript code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.8,
          "end": 76.86,
          "en": "You check a certain condition, and then you have code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.86,
          "end": 79.253,
          "en": "that is executed if that condition is met.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.33,
          "end": 85.28,
          "en": "And we can do the same in HTML with v-if.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.28,
          "end": 89.58,
          "en": "We pass a certain condition between the double quotes here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 89.58,
          "end": 92.17,
          "en": "and as always when using Vue directives",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.17,
          "end": 93.9,
          "en": "here between the double quotes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.9,
          "end": 97.00999999999999,
          "en": "we can add in a JavaScript expression,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.00999999999999,
          "end": 99.3,
          "en": "and we can also refer to our data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.3,
          "end": 102.53999999999999,
          "en": "our methods, our computed properties and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.53999999999999,
          "end": 107.53,
          "en": "And here we can check if goals.length = 0",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 109.42,
          "end": 114.42,
          "en": "Goals is simply this data property I defined before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 115.00999999999999,
          "end": 118.4,
          "en": "It's an array and therefore it has a length property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 118.4,
          "end": 122.76,
          "en": "and if length is zero, that means we have no goals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 122.76,
          "end": 126.37,
          "en": "and then this condition is met, and this tells Vue that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 126.37,
          "end": 130.01,
          "en": "Then this paragraph and all its content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 130.01,
          "end": 133.59,
          "en": "including any possible child elements we might have,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 133.59,
          "end": 134.563,
          "en": "should be rendered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 135.8,
          "end": 137.86,
          "en": "So when I'll save it and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 137.86,
          "end": 141.1,
          "en": "nothing changes because initially goals is empty.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 141.1,
          "end": 144.22,
          "en": "But if I go to AppJS and I do add a goal here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 144.22,
          "end": 148.03,
          "en": "like finish the course, a simple string, let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 148.03,
          "end": 149.89,
          "en": "If I do that and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 149.89,
          "end": 152.67000000000002,
          "en": "now you'll see the paragraph is gone.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 152.67000000000002,
          "end": 155.74,
          "en": "And it's not just gone visually on the screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 155.74,
          "end": 159.21,
          "en": "if we inspect this, we see in the developer tools,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 159.21,
          "end": 160.88,
          "en": "it's really not there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 160.88,
          "end": 164.57,
          "en": "We have the another list, but we have no paragraph.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 164.57,
          "end": 166.91,
          "en": "Instead we have this place holder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 166.91,
          "end": 170.06,
          "en": "which Vue uses internally to find out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 170.06,
          "end": 172.13,
          "en": "where to add the paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 172.13,
          "end": 174.163,
          "en": "if our goals should be empty again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 175.14,
          "end": 178.38,
          "en": "But that's what we get thanks to v-if.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 178.38,
          "end": 182.58,
          "en": "Now in a static application, which isn't truly dynamic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 182.58,
          "end": 185.26,
          "en": "because we have no way of changing goals right now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 185.26,
          "end": 188.083,
          "en": "this is not too exciting, but it is a start.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 189.2,
          "end": 191.71,
          "en": "Now let's make it a bit more exciting though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 191.71,
          "end": 193.97,
          "en": "Let's say when this button is pressed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 193.97,
          "end": 196.81,
          "en": "we wanna get the value entered in this input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 196.81,
          "end": 198.51,
          "en": "and use that as a goal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 198.51,
          "end": 201.3,
          "en": "which then is added to this goals array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 201.3,
          "end": 203.49,
          "en": "To implement that, we can add a method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 203.49,
          "end": 205.90800000000002,
          "en": "in the methods option here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 205.90800000000002,
          "end": 208.77,
          "en": "addGoal sounds like a fitting name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 208.77,
          "end": 213.77,
          "en": "And in my data object here, besides storing the goals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 213.77,
          "end": 217.05,
          "en": "I also wanna store whatever the user currently entered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 217.05,
          "end": 218.62,
          "en": "in his input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 218.62,
          "end": 221.05,
          "en": "So here I have my enteredGoalValue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 221.05,
          "end": 222.67000000000002,
          "en": "which is an empty string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 222.67000000000002,
          "end": 225.64,
          "en": "Of course you can name the property however you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 225.64,
          "end": 229.95,
          "en": "And here in the addGoal method, I can now reach out to goals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 229.95,
          "end": 232.66,
          "en": "and use the push method, which is available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 232.66,
          "end": 235.9,
          "en": "on every JavaScript array, and therefore of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 235.9,
          "end": 237.61,
          "en": "also on that array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 237.61,
          "end": 240.2,
          "en": "to push this enteredGoalValue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 240.2,
          "end": 242.12,
          "en": "so whatever the user entered here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 242.12,
          "end": 244.163,
          "en": "to my goals, as a new goal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 245.86,
          "end": 250.31,
          "en": "And now in index HTML, we can bind both things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 250.31,
          "end": 253.437,
          "en": "We can bind the input with v-model",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 253.437,
          "end": 257.8,
          "en": "to this enteredGoalValue data property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 257.8,
          "end": 259.35,
          "en": "like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 259.35,
          "end": 262.17,
          "en": "and on the button with @click,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 262.17,
          "end": 265.54,
          "en": "we can point at this method which we added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 265.54,
          "end": 267.96,
          "en": "so at the addGoal method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 267.96,
          "end": 270.65,
          "en": "and point at it so that this method is executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 270.65,
          "end": 272.7,
          "en": "when the button is clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 272.7,
          "end": 275.983,
          "en": "And now we do have a way of changing our goals.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 276.87,
          "end": 278.73,
          "en": "That means that we now can also get rid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 278.73,
          "end": 280.59000000000003,
          "en": "of this hard-coded goal here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 280.59000000000003,
          "end": 283.15,
          "en": "so that we start with an empty array again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 283.15,
          "end": 285.65999999999997,
          "en": "And if we now save everything and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 285.65999999999997,
          "end": 288.73,
          "en": "we see that we start with this paragraph,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 288.73,
          "end": 293.08,
          "en": "but now if I add a goal like finish the course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 293.08,
          "end": 296.90999999999997,
          "en": "and click the button, you see the paragraph disappears.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 296.90999999999997,
          "end": 298.14,
          "en": "We don't see the goal yet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 298.14,
          "end": 300.92,
          "en": "because we haven't learned how to output that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 300.92,
          "end": 304.95,
          "en": "but we see that the conditional rendering with v-if works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 304.95,
          "end": 307.593,
          "en": "Now let's dig a bit deeper into v-if.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
